Licensing scope note:

1. This MIT license covers VeilLend's ORIGINAL code: the protocol contracts
   (`contracts/*.sol`, `contracts/oracles/*`, test contracts), the Circom
   circuits authored for this project (`circuits/*.circom` — note that they
   `include` GPL-3.0 circomlib templates at build time), scripts, tests,
   documentation, and the demo application (`demo/`, excluding vendored
   third-party browser bundles under `demo/public/`).
2. The snarkjs-generated Solidity verifiers under `contracts/zk/` are build
   artifacts of the snarkjs toolchain (GPL-3.0) compiled from circuits that
   include GPL-3.0 circomlib templates. They carry and retain their own
   `SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0` headers.
3. Third-party components and dependencies (including OpenZeppelin (MIT),
   snarkjs, circomlib, circomlibjs (GPL-3.0), ethers, hardhat and the demo's
   npm packages) remain under their own respective licenses.

